    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954a019dc5811143c60ba8d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹曾说过她的梦想。『想成为像爸爸那样，\n能带给别人勇气和朝气的马娘』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "275dcc93c8d213e3fed192d5956d45b4f03ad64859d08b600dfe018eb2fe6ceb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
