    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fbc58e605b012d07d6b264",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了那第一步，北部玄驹赌上了一切。那是仅有一次机会\n的挑战。她把比烟花更炽热的感情，赌在这场『庆典』上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a256ff66952d9eeca2bb2e6860611828f460d768c399a42e21905c2f0c124f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068004.json",
