    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cdc0435143f7e3277546eb0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，拜托了！！　赐予我，只属于我自己的\n武器――！！　然后，使其比任何人的都强大――！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed4926288520dbf18f7c9210d906372828624eb12b7c513be27d267f3ad14b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
